description=Event and admin toolkit: siege events, base raids, a ground sweep, a login shield, roadside bushes that clear under wheels, and shift+right-click on a Shortcut slot to gather a recipe's materials from nearby containers. If you belong to more than one safehouse, the User Panel's Safehouse button now lets you pick which one to open, so a second membership can actually be quit. Staff arm events from the right-click menu; every setting lives in Admin Panel - Sandbox Options - Wabbajack Server Toolkit, adjustable live with no restart. Events are server-side and place only vanilla items and zombies; the gather shortcut is client-side and needs TheShortcut, but the mod works without it.
